          "caption": "When the Snaefell Mountain Railway is running to a half hourly service, trains are timed to cross just outside the station. See here no.6 has just left on the 15:40 Snaefell Summit to Laxey with no.2 arriving in on the 15:15 Laxey to Snaefell Summit. Date taken = 29 July 2017.",
